{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>近日好評如潮的Grok Bot 突被大幅降用量，引起用戶不滿。相反，越來越進取的 Muse from Meta 就提供很大用量給用戶，但暫時未對香港／台灣開放，只提供 Waiting List。本文簡單快速教大家如何突破限制，跨區申請 Muse 帳戶，並提供 10 億枚 Muse 代幣領取方法。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"muse\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/muse-1024x538.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2>簡單流程</h2>\n<p>要在不支援 Muse 的地區申請帳戶，可以用 VPN 連到美國，然後用瀏覽器以 E-mail 申請（不下載 App 也可）。雖然申請要用 VPN，但開戶後就不用再連住 VPN，在大多數地區自由使用。</p>\n<h2>Muse 申請攻略</h2>\n<p>1：首先，連接 VPN 到美國（近日 <a href=\"https://go.nordvpn.net/aff_c?offer_id=15&amp;aff_id=11236\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NordVPN</a> / <a href=\"https://billing.purevpn.com/aff.php?aff=41724\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PureVPN</a> 也推出 Black Friday 優惠，可考慮）。</p>\n<p>2：用電腦瀏覽器申請會較簡單，因為要正式開放的地區 App Store /Google Play帳號（如美國）才可下載 App，因此我們要用 Browser 申請，<a href=\"https://muse.ai/join\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">開啟 Meta AI 申請頁面</a> <a href=\"https://muse.ai/join\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://muse.ai/join</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"muse join01\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"623\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/muse-join01.webp\" width=\"919\"/></figure>\n<p>3：最重要步驟是「千萬不要登入」 Meta 帳號！要用 E-mail 來申請！</p>\n<p>4：輸入 E-mail 代碼以註冊。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"muse 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"517\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/muse-1.webp\" width=\"652\"/></figure>\n<p>5：接著輸入出生日期，要成年才可用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"muse age\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"497\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/muse-age.webp\" width=\"882\"/></figure>\n<p>6：看到須知事項後按「開始使用」。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 11 09 10.14.21\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"737\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-09-10.14.21.webp\" width=\"862\"/></figure>\n<h2>領取 10 億枚 Muse 代幣</h2>\n<p>1：先到 Muse 的左下方選單進入設定。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 11 09 10.35.09\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-09-10.35.09.webp\" width=\"336\"/></figure>\n<p>2：在設定的「一般」選「兌換邀請代碼」，只要輸入 <strong>D7W1WO</strong> 就可以拿到！</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 11 09 10.21.05\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"611\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-09-10.21.05.webp\" width=\"796\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 11 09 10.50.54\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"513\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-09-10.50.54.webp\" width=\"484\"/></figure>\n<p>兌換碼：<br/>D7W1WO</p>\n<h2>下載 Muse 手機 App</h2>\n<p>由於 Muse from Meta 只是對部份地區開放，所以香港／台灣等地區的 App Store 是不能下載 App，不過換成美國 App Store 帳戶<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/muse-from-meta/id6760173601\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">即可下載</a>。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"230x511bb 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/230x511bb-1.webp\" width=\"230\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/230x511bb.webp\" width=\"230\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>初時可叫 Muse 做什麼任務？</h2>\n<p>最簡單就是叫它管理你的 E-mail，這樣它可從中認識你，了解你的需要！你之後更可連結你的 Meta 各項服務，成為你的全方助手。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 11 09 10.20.38\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-09-10.20.38.webp\" width=\"928\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.744894+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":819,"images":11,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:11.360504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:34.219733+00:00","content_hash":"01375b39c082beec1ebcc7862be40d9b741c9925589462feae40a1a6c37b5f4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.744894+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}